(5977798, 875140, 57447, '<td valign="top">Weird, cool.</td>', 'Weird, cool.', '2010-04-28 17:49:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5977802, 874587, 57447, '<td valign="top">Very artsy type exposure.  I like it.</td>', 'Very artsy type exposure.  I like it.', '2010-04-28 17:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5977803, 875202, 57447, '<td valign="top">Good work.</td>', 'Good work.', '2010-04-28 17:51:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5977804, 874566, 57447, '<td valign="top">Creative idea.</td>', 'Creative idea.', '2010-04-28 17:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5977805, 875184, 57447, '<td valign="top">Hahahhaha, this is funny.</td>', 'Hahahhaha, this is funny.', '2010-04-28 17:52:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5977810, 874579, 57447, '<td valign="top">Ha...cute.</td>', 'Ha...cute.', '2010-04-28 17:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5977830, 875201, 96881, '<td valign="top">Very very well done.........Not sure straight off what the red marks are (is that the remote for the camera flash?) but the composition and execution of this is exceptionally well done.........</td>', 'Very very well done.........Not sure straight off what the red marks are (is that the remote for the camera flash?) but the composition and execution of this is exceptionally well done.........', '2010-04-28 18:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5977834, 874366, 96881, '<td valign="top">A well set up image that works well.  Dual firing of the flash to get both images (and putting on a jumper between).  A really good image for the challenge.<br/> <br/>While difficult (probably impossible) to do, the only thing that gets me on this is the whole image is static, whereas it really does need some dynamic element to it, whether that is a slight blur to the fist and the head or something.  That is the only thing that would turn this into a brilliant image</td>', 'A well set up image that works well.  Dual firing of the flash to get both images (and putting on a jumper between).  A really good image for the challenge. While difficult (probably impossible) to do, the only thing that gets me on this is the whole image is static, whereas it really does need some dynamic element to it, whether that is a slight blur to the fist and the head or something.  That is the only thing that would turn this into a brilliant image', '2010-04-28 18:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5977837, 874938, 96881, '<td valign="top">I presume this used covering the lens with a very long exposure time to achieve the duel exposure.  The moons are well lit, but in the end the image doesn''t really grab me.  I would prefer (but doesn''t meet the challenge) to see just the left moon, and thus the double exposure does not add to the image for me.</td>', 'I presume this used covering the lens with a very long exposure time to achieve the duel exposure.  The moons are well lit, but in the end the image doesn''t really grab me.  I would prefer (but doesn''t meet the challenge) to see just the left moon, and thus the double exposure does not add to the image for me.', '2010-04-28 18:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5977840, 875231, 96881, '<td valign="top">Clever, very clever..........<br/> <br/>Well composed and executed here.  A great idea that does work well......</td>', 'Clever, very clever.......... Well composed and executed here.  A great idea that does work well......', '2010-04-28 18:15:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5977846, 874820, 67258, '<td valign="top">Extraordinary. A powerful and thoroughly impressive photograph.</td>', 'Extraordinary. A powerful and thoroughly impressive photograph.', '2010-04-28 18:18:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5977863, 873346, 49954, '<td valign="top">appears to be slow shutter, not double exposure</td>', 'appears to be slow shutter, not double exposure', '2010-04-28 18:30:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5977871, 875208, 67258, '<td valign="top">...and a headless dog!.  Good idea, well executed.</td>', '...and a headless dog!.  Good idea, well executed.', '2010-04-28 18:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5977920, 874793, 78445, '<td valign="top">Wow great shot</td>', 'Wow great shot', '2010-04-28 18:59:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5977930, 874599, 115671, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting one, the facial expressions seem very realistic and the positioning is excellent. The table seems to have tilted slightly on the second exposure, perhaps you could have found a more stable table/surface.</td>', 'This is an interesting one, the facial expressions seem very realistic and the positioning is excellent. The table seems to have tilted slightly on the second exposure, perhaps you could have found a more stable table/surface.', '2010-04-28 19:07:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5977932, 874660, 115671, '<td valign="top">Great idea! The lighting of the subject(s) is perfect and really gives me a creepy feeling. The flares from the street lamp are distracting, however.</td>', 'Great idea! The lighting of the subject(s) is perfect and really gives me a creepy feeling. The flares from the street lamp are distracting, however.', '2010-04-28 19:10:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5977934, 874351, 115671, '<td valign="top">I have mixed feelings about this one. The composition without the hands would have been perfect for my taste, the lighting is great, but the hands are too blurry and remind me more of someone typing really really quickly more than of a double exposure. I''m not sure if you used a flash for this one, but a secondary flash to light up the hands would have eliminated what looks like motion blur on them.</td>', 'I have mixed feelings about this one. The composition without the hands would have been perfect for my taste, the lighting is great, but the hands are too blurry and remind me more of someone typing really really quickly more than of a double exposure. I''m not sure if you used a flash for this one, but a secondary flash to light up the hands would have eliminated what looks like motion blur on them.', '2010-04-28 19:13:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5977936, 875188, 115671, '<td valign="top">I love the idea behind this one. The label is a little distracting and the crop on the right side at least could have been a bit wider to avoid it touching the label edge. The frog''s expression is priceless :)</td>', 'I love the idea behind this one. The label is a little distracting and the crop on the right side at least could have been a bit wider to avoid it touching the label edge. The frog''s expression is priceless :)', '2010-04-28 19:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5977951, 874663, 115671, '<td valign="top">Great wall colour and just the right exposure, the label on the horizontal bottle draws attention to it as it looks much more realistic than the rest of the two bottles. For some reason the composition doesn''t work great for me, but i really have no idea why. Also, i don''t understand the connection between the title and what''s on the photo. Good luck :)</td>', 'Great wall colour and just the right exposure, the label on the horizontal bottle draws attention to it as it looks much more realistic than the rest of the two bottles. For some reason the composition doesn''t work great for me, but i really have no idea why. Also, i don''t understand the connection between the title and what''s on the photo. Good luck :)', '2010-04-28 19:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5977952, 874707, 115671, '<td valign="top">The center point of the subject is just too busy to look at. Nice idea, though. I love the intensity of the blue color on this one.</td>', 'The center point of the subject is just too busy to look at. Nice idea, though. I love the intensity of the blue color on this one.', '2010-04-28 19:24:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5977961, 875189, 115671, '<td valign="top">The subject(s) are too transparent, i think, and the facial expression on the right one is just too calm to be in an argument. His right hand looks more like he''s going to hit the other guy than like he''s in an argument. I learned the hard way (in this challenge) that in order to have the subject less transparent, you have to have the background as dark as possible, and the subject as well lit as possible.</td>', 'The subject(s) are too transparent, i think, and the facial expression on the right one is just too calm to be in an argument. His right hand looks more like he''s going to hit the other guy than like he''s in an argument. I learned the hard way (in this challenge) that in order to have the subject less transparent, you have to have the background as dark as possible, and the subject as well lit as possible.', '2010-04-28 19:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5977965, 874958, 115671, '<td valign="top">The moon is a little disproportionate to the racket. Original idea and nice execution.</td>', 'The moon is a little disproportionate to the racket. Original idea and nice execution.', '2010-04-28 19:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5977970, 873014, 115671, '<td valign="top">Great idea and a great photo. I really like how the final lighting looks like, and b&amp;w really works for this.</td>', 'Great idea and a great photo. I really like how the final lighting looks like, and b&w really works for this.', '2010-04-28 19:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5977973, 873002, 115671, '<td valign="top">This is too blurry and has a lot of artifacts. The borders are soft as well. Leaves me with an impression that this photo was resized from a much smaller photo format. I''m not sure if i''m seeing selective desaturation, but it definitely brings those artifacts to light.</td>', 'This is too blurry and has a lot of artifacts. The borders are soft as well. Leaves me with an impression that this photo was resized from a much smaller photo format. I''m not sure if i''m seeing selective desaturation, but it definitely brings those artifacts to light.', '2010-04-28 19:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5977977, 875158, 115671, '<td valign="top">The only distraction here are the crossings between the different exposures. Don''t know if you tried a triangular composition instead of a linear one, maybe it would have worked as well? The facial expressions are great.</td>', 'The only distraction here are the crossings between the different exposures. Don''t know if you tried a triangular composition instead of a linear one, maybe it would have worked as well? The facial expressions are great.', '2010-04-28 19:51:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5977982, 874798, 115671, '<td valign="top">Great setup, made me laugh. I''d kill someone if that happened to me :) The yellow/dark contrast is great.</td>', 'Great setup, made me laugh. I''d kill someone if that happened to me :) The yellow/dark contrast is great.', '2010-04-28 19:54:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5977985, 872070, 115671, '<td valign="top">I have looked really hard and i can''t see the double exposure. Maybe it''s just me though, good luck.</td>', 'I have looked really hard and i can''t see the double exposure. Maybe it''s just me though, good luck.', '2010-04-28 19:55:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5977988, 875093, 115671, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure how others will vote feeling uneasy about the bubble gum in their eyes, but i''m giving this one an 8. The beards are seamlessly integrated, i like that.</td>', 'I''m not sure how others will vote feeling uneasy about the bubble gum in their eyes, but i''m giving this one an 8. The beards are seamlessly integrated, i like that.', '2010-04-28 19:57:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5977997, 874345, 115671, '<td valign="top">Not sure what happened in post-processing, the skin looks solarized a bit.</td>', 'Not sure what happened in post-processing, the skin looks solarized a bit.', '2010-04-28 20:04:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5978000, 873055, 115671, '<td valign="top">I actually really like this one, although i would like to know what i''m looking at. Looks like some water on one exposure, and some objects (trees maybe or some stones?) and their reflections in the water. All in all, it has a great warm tone to it.</td>', 'I actually really like this one, although i would like to know what i''m looking at. Looks like some water on one exposure, and some objects (trees maybe or some stones?) and their reflections in the water. All in all, it has a great warm tone to it.', '2010-04-28 20:05:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5978004, 874820, 115307, '<td valign="top">Process: One turns the couch upside down. Then one sits on the couch upside down. Then one crawls normally on the floor. <br/>Did I get it right?<br/>You have a great imagination, and I really like the feel of this photo.<br/>My one suggestion is that I think the idea of "inner demon" would have been expressed even better if the person sitting on the couch had a more normal expression. <br/>Well done!</td>', 'Process: One turns the couch upside down. Then one sits on the couch upside down. Then one crawls normally on the floor. Did I get it right?You have a great imagination, and I really like the feel of this photo.My one suggestion is that I think the idea of "inner demon" would have been expressed even better if the person sitting on the couch had a more normal expression. Well done!', '2010-04-28 20:12:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5978027, 874566, 115671, '<td valign="top">This leaves the impression of a two headed creature impaled on a vertical spear near the image center.</td>', 'This leaves the impression of a two headed creature impaled on a vertical spear near the image center.', '2010-04-28 20:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5978042, 874730, 100831, '<td valign="top">interesting overlay effect and I like the tilt.</td>', 'interesting overlay effect and I like the tilt.', '2010-04-28 20:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5978084, 875193, 115671, '<td valign="top">There''s just too much going on at the same time.</td>', 'There''s just too much going on at the same time.', '2010-04-28 21:02:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5978089, 875221, 115671, '<td valign="top">Looks nice, must have been frustrating to do it over and over again. I just wish there were no blue specks in the lower half of the image.</td>', 'Looks nice, must have been frustrating to do it over and over again. I just wish there were no blue specks in the lower half of the image.', '2010-04-28 21:05:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5978094, 872096, 115671, '<td valign="top">This was among the three pics i liked the best while looking through the thumbnails for this competition. I love the minimalism and the contrast the white numbers make against a black background. It''s almost like a subliminal ad for philips though (you can see it written on the left if you boost the contrast a little bit). Great photo in my humble opinion.</td>', 'This was among the three pics i liked the best while looking through the thumbnails for this competition. I love the minimalism and the contrast the white numbers make against a black background. It''s almost like a subliminal ad for philips though (you can see it written on the left if you boost the contrast a little bit). Great photo in my humble opinion.', '2010-04-28 21:07:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5978101, 875160, 115671, '<td valign="top">Original idea. The glare is unfortunate, and there''s 3-4 glare-ish areas.</td>', 'Original idea. The glare is unfortunate, and there''s 3-4 glare-ish areas.', '2010-04-28 21:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5978103, 874711, 115671, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject, and you could have done a different kind of shot with that subject as well, by showing them as inside one another.</td>', 'Interesting subject, and you could have done a different kind of shot with that subject as well, by showing them as inside one another.', '2010-04-28 21:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5978108, 874730, 115671, '<td valign="top">Excellent. I love how the blown background neutralizes the rest of the other exposure.</td>', 'Excellent. I love how the blown background neutralizes the rest of the other exposure.', '2010-04-28 21:14:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5978116, 875120, 115671, '<td valign="top">Interesting lighting on both subject(s).</td>', 'Interesting lighting on both subject(s).', '2010-04-28 21:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5978117, 875090, 49088, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry but I don''t see the double exposure in this one?</td>', 'I''m sorry but I don''t see the double exposure in this one?', '2010-04-28 21:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5978118, 874495, 115671, '<td valign="top">This might score lower because of the noise and the light background. You wouldn''t hit a guy wearing glasses, would you?</td>', 'This might score lower because of the noise and the light background. You wouldn''t hit a guy wearing glasses, would you?', '2010-04-28 21:18:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5978120, 874118, 115671, '<td valign="top">You just voided your warranty by using the lens cap the way they weren''t meant to be used by Nikon. Very creative, nice shot</td>', 'You just voided your warranty by using the lens cap the way they weren''t meant to be used by Nikon. Very creative, nice shot', '2010-04-28 21:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5978122, 874946, 115671, '<td valign="top">The flower closest to the lens looks huge and is a bit distracting. Also, the posture makes it look more like you''re trying to pull the tree out rather than hug it :)</td>', 'The flower closest to the lens looks huge and is a bit distracting. Also, the posture makes it look more like you''re trying to pull the tree out rather than hug it :)', '2010-04-28 21:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5978124, 874620, 115671, '<td valign="top">Made me laugh :D<br/>I like it how you made the two subjects look different, wearing different clothes.</td>', 'Made me laugh :DI like it how you made the two subjects look different, wearing different clothes.', '2010-04-28 21:22:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5978130, 874579, 116481, '<td valign="top">Great concept!</td>', 'Great concept!', '2010-04-28 21:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5978132, 875214, 115671, '<td valign="top">I''m jealous of this shot. How did you make the guitar stable by just leaning it on that chair?</td>', 'I''m jealous of this shot. How did you make the guitar stable by just leaning it on that chair?', '2010-04-28 21:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5978133, 874718, 116481, '<td valign="top">Nice picture and great use of light, but it''s not the double exposure that really makes this shot interesting. :-)</td>', 'Nice picture and great use of light, but it''s not the double exposure that really makes this shot interesting. :-)', '2010-04-28 21:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5978134, 873014, 116481, '<td valign="top">Well posed :-)</td>', 'Well posed :-)', '2010-04-28 21:25:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5978135, 874793, 116481, '<td valign="top">Great inventive use of perspective!</td>', 'Great inventive use of perspective!', '2010-04-28 21:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5978141, 875118, 73942, '<td valign="top">great idea with very good results</td>', 'great idea with very good results', '2010-04-28 21:30:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5978144, 874820, 115671, '<td valign="top">Fantastic. I''d love to read how you created that textured effect visible on the wall and floor in basic editing. Possibly a third exposure of something textured? :)<br/>And where did you mount the camera? <br/>Very intriguing shot.</td>', 'Fantastic. I''d love to read how you created that textured effect visible on the wall and floor in basic editing. Possibly a third exposure of something textured? :)And where did you mount the camera? Very intriguing shot.', '2010-04-28 21:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
