(5987365, 875213, 114302, '<td valign="top">Personally not a fan of this picture. Your shutterspeed in both elements of the picture were too slow and your ISO was way to high by the very visible grain in the photo. Also i find the photo distracting because in the other exposure (people) There are several people that draw attention. In future i suggest you just shoot on a black background with a flash; then it won''t add any data except your subject. Also on the flag i''m not sure if you were going for a rustic feel/ approach but the stripes look almost pink for some reason. So i would adjust my White Balence.</td>', 'Personally not a fan of this picture. Your shutterspeed in both elements of the picture were too slow and your ISO was way to high by the very visible grain in the photo. Also i find the photo distracting because in the other exposure (people) There are several people that draw attention. In future i suggest you just shoot on a black background with a flash; then it won''t add any data except your subject. Also on the flag i''m not sure if you were going for a rustic feel/ approach but the stripes look almost pink for some reason. So i would adjust my White Balence.', '2010-05-03 10:37:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5987380, 875189, 114302, '<td valign="top">I like this photo; even the ''off kilter'' camera angle seems to work here. Great placement of what i assume to be yourself. Only thing i would improve on is on the person to the left. His right eye seems to have like a dot and its a huge contrast and my eyes went right there when i saw the pic. Overall very nice; i imagine you used the bulit in flash for the pic; but maybe try usinga  difusor on it or a smaller aperature because the table is  just a bit brighter than it should be; and you would get rid of a little bit of the background bringing our your subjects. Nice shot. 7</td>', 'I like this photo; even the ''off kilter'' camera angle seems to work here. Great placement of what i assume to be yourself. Only thing i would improve on is on the person to the left. His right eye seems to have like a dot and its a huge contrast and my eyes went right there when i saw the pic. Overall very nice; i imagine you used the bulit in flash for the pic; but maybe try usinga  difusor on it or a smaller aperature because the table is  just a bit brighter than it should be; and you would get rid of a little bit of the background bringing our your subjects. Nice shot. 7', '2010-05-03 10:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5987387, 874118, 114302, '<td valign="top">Don''t personally like the photo; i don''t really see the difference in it all to much. Probably if you had focused on the texture a bit more and a different angle the shot woulda turned out better. Better luck next time.</td>', 'Don''t personally like the photo; i don''t really see the difference in it all to much. Probably if you had focused on the texture a bit more and a different angle the shot woulda turned out better. Better luck next time.', '2010-05-03 10:43:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5987392, 875069, 114302, '<td valign="top">really eery photo. I wouldn''t say i ''like'' the photo because of what it depicts however i like the elements in this photo. Only problem i see is something reflective top right of the top subject. Its a bit distracting. Also had you made the man appear a little more ghosty''ish woulda improved the score (atleast mine) a little bit. Overall nice photo(s)</td>', 'really eery photo. I wouldn''t say i ''like'' the photo because of what it depicts however i like the elements in this photo. Only problem i see is something reflective top right of the top subject. Its a bit distracting. Also had you made the man appear a little more ghosty''ish woulda improved the score (atleast mine) a little bit. Overall nice photo(s)', '2010-05-03 10:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5987395, 875221, 114302, '<td valign="top">I like this shot; highly creative. I personally couldn''t think of a way to improve on this. Maybe just the clarity but its hard to tell on something transparent. 9</td>', 'I like this shot; highly creative. I personally couldn''t think of a way to improve on this. Maybe just the clarity but its hard to tell on something transparent. 9', '2010-05-03 10:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5987400, 875137, 114302, '<td valign="top">Really creepy photo; so nice appeal. I like the ocean in this picture its actually astounding. The ghosty person makes the photo. Only problem i see is a near merger between her shirt and the ocean; so changing her shirt would have a positive effect. If it were black she would appear compleatly see through (from my little time w/ double exposures) And create a cool effect. 7</td>', 'Really creepy photo; so nice appeal. I like the ocean in this picture its actually astounding. The ghosty person makes the photo. Only problem i see is a near merger between her shirt and the ocean; so changing her shirt would have a positive effect. If it were black she would appear compleatly see through (from my little time w/ double exposures) And create a cool effect. 7', '2010-05-03 10:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5987404, 874866, 114302, '<td valign="top">Great photo! Really eyecatching and your eye goes right to the subjects and stays there. Excellent composition. 9</td>', 'Great photo! Really eyecatching and your eye goes right to the subjects and stays there. Excellent composition. 9', '2010-05-03 10:50:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5987406, 875188, 114302, '<td valign="top">very comical nice. I''m not a fan of the grain in the frog tho and the location. Had it been just a little higher woulda made the photo alot better. Also had it been a real frog would have made the photo amazing. 3</td>', 'very comical nice. I''m not a fan of the grain in the frog tho and the location. Had it been just a little higher woulda made the photo alot better. Also had it been a real frog would have made the photo amazing. 3', '2010-05-03 10:51:21.000000', NULL, 1),
