(5989064, 872070, 67258, '<td valign="top">I am completely missing the double-exposure effect here. As far as the photo goes, it seems to have been taken in fairly bright light . The shadow that cuts across the right hand prong of the anchor is distracting, and the smaller green anchor gets rather lost against the green background of the deck surface.</td>', 'I am completely missing the double-exposure effect here. As far as the photo goes, it seems to have been taken in fairly bright light . The shadow that cuts across the right hand prong of the anchor is distracting, and the smaller green anchor gets rather lost against the green background of the deck surface.', '2010-05-04 09:02:18.000000', NULL, 1),
