(5989301, 875069, 49954, '<td valign="top">Hm... interesting shot and processing, maybe a little over Topazed.  However, it does not truly convey double exposure because the shot COULD have been achieved in a single exposure... had the same actor been in the bed/sofa and above, then it would have made more sense for the theme.</td>', 'Hm... interesting shot and processing, maybe a little over Topazed.  However, it does not truly convey double exposure because the shot COULD have been achieved in a single exposure... had the same actor been in the bed/sofa and above, then it would have made more sense for the theme.', '2010-05-04 11:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5989305, 874376, 49954, '<td valign="top">Interesting and clever shot!  A little dark in exposure (as well as tone).  However, -2 for doing four exposures instead of a double exposure.  Bummer because I''m sure this took a LOT of work to do!!! 7-2 = 5</td>', 'Interesting and clever shot!  A little dark in exposure (as well as tone).  However, -2 for doing four exposures instead of a double exposure.  Bummer because I''m sure this took a LOT of work to do!!! 7-2 = 5', '2010-05-04 11:51:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5989311, 874711, 49954, '<td valign="top">interesting angle.  But a -2 strike for doing five "exposures" instead of a double per the challenge.  Not a full DNMC, but a fair penalty.</td>', 'interesting angle.  But a -2 strike for doing five "exposures" instead of a double per the challenge.  Not a full DNMC, but a fair penalty.', '2010-05-04 11:57:09.000000', NULL, 1),
