(5991017, 875184, 18655, '<td valign="top">Congrats with a well deserved top 5 Shannon. I bet all the 1''s and low scores are from voters that thought there would be no way to accomplish the transition as you did it between the dog and your daughter in basic mode.<br/>Can''t really blame them though since it really does look like you have put two images together ''manually'' and made the transition by changing the opacity selectively on the top of the dog. But the voters should always vote as if the shot is legal and leave it for the SC to decide - which as it turns out the majority of the voters luckily did.</td>', 'Congrats with a well deserved top 5 Shannon. I bet all the 1''s and low scores are from voters that thought there would be no way to accomplish the transition as you did it between the dog and your daughter in basic mode.Can''t really blame them though since it really does look like you have put two images together ''manually'' and made the transition by changing the opacity selectively on the top of the dog. But the voters should always vote as if the shot is legal and leave it for the SC to decide - which as it turns out the majority of the voters luckily did.', '2010-05-05 01:20:09.000000', NULL, 0),
