(5992050, 875184, 30982, '<td valign="top">As an FYI only, on my overly bright monitor the background is VERY color-noisy.  May have affected some of the laptop voters who have screens tilted badly.  Or those with too bright monitors.  It didn''t hurt the score too much, though.  :-)</td>', 'As an FYI only, on my overly bright monitor the background is VERY color-noisy.  May have affected some of the laptop voters who have screens tilted badly.  Or those with too bright monitors.  It didn''t hurt the score too much, though.  :-)', '2010-05-05 10:47:10.000000', NULL, 0),
