(5993674, 874371, 22734, '<td valign="top">Very well done. I once entered a similar image but with a candle instead. I am sure you did better. I thought the flame pointed upside down would have proved interesting. Regardless, you have a technique that can lend itself to other ideas.</td>', 'Very well done. I once entered a similar image but with a candle instead. I am sure you did better. I thought the flame pointed upside down would have proved interesting. Regardless, you have a technique that can lend itself to other ideas.', '2010-05-06 02:29:58.000000', NULL, 0),
