(5994993, 875155, 22734, '<td valign="top">Subtle. This is the type of idea that requires a lot of takes. Yet, it still looks pleasing.</td>', 'Subtle. This is the type of idea that requires a lot of takes. Yet, it still looks pleasing.', '2010-05-06 23:50:15.000000', NULL, 0),
