(5997720, 874795, 22734, '<td valign="top">The colors are very nice but despite the activity in the pictures it remains a tad static. But hey, a future challenge may encourage you to prepare earlier.</td>', 'The colors are very nice but despite the activity in the pictures it remains a tad static. But hey, a future challenge may encourage you to prepare earlier.', '2010-05-08 20:32:23.000000', NULL, 0),
